MongoDB Operators
1. Comparison Operators
$eq   // equal
$ne   // not equal
$gt   // greater than
$lt   // less than
$gte  // greater than or equal
$lte  // less than or equal
$in   // matches any in array
$nin  // not in array

2. Logical Operators
$and
$or
$not
$nor

3. Update Operators
$set      // set field value
$inc      // increment value
$unset    // remove field
$rename   // rename field

4. Array Operators
$push     // add item to array
$pull     // remove item from array
$pop      // remove first/last item
$addToSet // add item only if it doesn’t exist
